<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Land shares suspended - KLSE.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Land shares suspended - KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Berjaya Land Bhd were suspended from Thursday trading at the company's request, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said.</p>
<p>Shares of the Malaysian property development and hotel management firm, formerly known as Berjaya Leisure Bhd, were last traded at 5.80 ringgit on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
